{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>And it came to pass in the fortieth year, in the eleventh month.</b> He rebuked them close to his death, and so is the way of the righteous — to rebuke close to their death. Thus we find in Jacob, and thus we find in Joshua, who did not rebuke Israel except close to his death; and so Samuel, peace be upon him, said (I Samuel 12:3): ״הנני ענו בי״; and so we find in David, peace be upon him, to Solomon his son."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:44:27.049492760Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}